A||||8||Eric_PA||Anyone ever deal with ACE||||5||
Z||000000||Eric_PA||01-03-2001||01:03 PM||||I was wondering if going to ACE would be a good idea for an engine swap kit to install my QUAD 4. I have tried to com up with a good way to mount the engine in the subframe, but have not been happy with my attempts. They offer a kit for $1800 and want me to send my gauges and wiring harness. I am skeptical of this. What I am wondering is, should I trust them?<P>Thanks in advance<BR>Eric<BR>Black 86.5 Fastback<BR>Red 84 4 speed snow car  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ||||reg||5
Z||000001||stimpy||01-03-2001||02:13 PM||||I have heard a variety of opinions on ACE, from very poor to very favorable.  My dad had ACE install a s/c 3.8 in his 86 GT and had considerable problems with it after they were done. If I were to get a 3.8 swap done on my own car, I would go for West Coast Fieros. As far as the Quad4 swap, I haven't heard of anyone having ACE do that, which would lead me to believe that they are not deep in experience with this swap.  That being said, if you can do without the harness and guages and don't mind not really knowing what is going on with your parts, then let them have a go at it.  ||||reg||1
Z||000002||kevin||01-03-2001||02:58 PM||||Hey Eric, BEWARE! I did considerable investigation on these guys. The result were bombastic!  I was able to find many cutomers who trusted these guys and got burned for thousands of unforseable expenses. What made these stories shameful is ACE never admitted liability. Their shop incidentaly is their fron yard of a resedential housing tract. I am also looking for a competent shop to do my Quad-4 swap. Be patient, talk to others on the Forum.I would start by talking to George at the Fiero Shop in Hayward, CA or Chris West ins Playa del Ray, CA. Both have extensive Fiero experince, but not so much in Quad-4's. But they can at least be trusted. You want reading material on ACE? Simple contact me. Hope this helps. Kevin. ||||reg||8
Z||000003||fieroparts.com||01-03-2001||04:38 PM||||GOT MONEY?.....LOTS OF IT?................IF YOUR LAST NAME IS GATES  (BILL)  AND HAVE STOCK IN <BR>BAYER ASPRIN CO. THEN GO FOR IT!!!<P>ACE IS A JOKE<P>------------------<BR>1988 GT  000117.1 MILES T-TOPS LOADED MED. RED<BR>AS NEW AS THEY GET!||||reg||1
